1
00:00:00,254 --> 00:00:01,575
Four mythologies.

2
00:00:01,691 --> 00:00:03,777
Only one tells how the world ends.

3
00:00:04,159 --> 00:00:05,922
The Greeks have no apocalypse.

4
00:00:06,060 --> 00:00:07,930
Hesiod only foretells the end of a

5
00:00:07,741 --> 00:00:08,598
race of men:

6
00:00:08,668 --> 00:00:10,398
the gods and the world go on.

7
00:00:10,779 --> 00:00:12,779
The Egyptian texts read here have none

8
00:00:12,590 --> 00:00:13,135
either:

9
00:00:13,204 --> 00:00:15,042
the dead are promised millions of millions

10
00:00:14,853 --> 00:00:15,591
of years.

11
00:00:15,962 --> 00:00:18,392
Ovid, the Roman poet, leaves a single

12
00:00:18,203 --> 00:00:18,974
sentence:

13
00:00:19,055 --> 00:00:20,914
one day, a fire will destroy the

14
00:00:20,725 --> 00:00:21,561
universe.

15
00:00:21,928 --> 00:00:23,917
But the Norse poem Voluspa tells it

16
00:00:23,728 --> 00:00:25,059
stanza by stanza.

17
00:00:25,192 --> 00:00:26,847
The wolf breaks its fetters.

18
00:00:26,992 --> 00:00:28,442
Heimdall blows the horn.

19
00:00:28,818 --> 00:00:30,386
Odin falls to the wolf.

20
00:00:30,503 --> 00:00:33,106
Thor kills the serpent, walks nine paces…

21
00:00:33,078 --> 00:00:33,914
and dies.

22
00:00:34,307 --> 00:00:36,512
The sun turns black, the earth sinks

23
00:00:36,323 --> 00:00:38,171
into the sea, and the stars fall

24
00:00:37,982 --> 00:00:38,839
from the sky.

25
00:00:39,223 --> 00:00:40,684
And the part people forget:

26
00:00:40,754 --> 00:00:42,678
the earth rises again from the waves,

27
00:00:42,661 --> 00:00:43,249
green.

28
00:00:43,365 --> 00:00:44,815
And Baldr comes back.

29
00:00:45,219 --> 00:00:46,152
One detail:

30
00:00:46,222 --> 00:00:48,210
Hesiod and the Voluspa share a sign

31
00:00:48,021 --> 00:00:48,771
of the end.

32
00:00:48,882 --> 00:00:50,439
Brother against brother.

33
00:00:50,810 --> 00:00:52,238
Which text says so?

34
00:00:52,355 --> 00:00:54,516
The Voluspa, in the Poetic Edda.

35
00:00:54,897 --> 00:00:56,885
Save it, and send it to anyone

36
00:00:56,696 --> 00:00:59,116
who thinks every mythology has its apocalypse.

